  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You trace a sigil in the air, and it appears on a creature you can see within range, which makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d8 Fire damage on a failure or half as much on a success. Either way, the target radiates heat in a 10-foot Emanation until the end of its next turn. At the start of the target’s next turn, the target and each creature in the Emanation must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d8 Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> Both the initial and the later damage increase by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 2.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
